2128
00:02:48,737 --> 00:02:50,027
Re-l.

2129
00:02:50,027 --> 00:02:54,447
We're at a loss as to what to do with you.

2130
00:02:54,447 --> 00:03:00,207
Your selfish actions were well beyond the bounds of a citizen.

2131
00:03:00,787 --> 00:03:04,417
The same can be said of you as well, Raul.

2132
00:03:04,417 --> 00:03:05,337
Yes, sir.

2133
00:03:05,337 --> 00:03:10,507
However, the benefits accompanying her return are great.

2134
00:03:10,797 --> 00:03:14,217
Benefits that may even sustain Romdeau.

2135
00:03:14,677 --> 00:03:18,017
The Administrator is happy about that.

2136
00:03:19,267 --> 00:03:20,727
Grandfather is?

2137
00:03:22,347 --> 00:03:26,267
<i>I didn't know what was going on at first,</i>

2138
00:03:27,727 --> 00:03:30,737
<i>but I gradually realized</i>

2139
00:03:31,777 --> 00:03:38,237
<i>that for some reason, my - Vincent Law's - consciousness</i>

2140
00:03:38,537 --> 00:03:41,617
<i>had entered Re-l.</i>

2141
00:03:44,207 --> 00:03:47,667
<i>In other words, I saw everything through Re-l's eyes</i>

2142
00:03:47,667 --> 00:03:50,547
<i>and heard everything through Re-l's ears.</i>

2143
00:03:51,087 --> 00:03:55,007
meditation   sacred eye of the void

2144
00:03:54,217 --> 00:03:55,007
Re-l.

2145
00:03:56,677 --> 00:03:57,807
Swan.

2146
00:03:57,807 --> 00:04:00,177
I should've known you'd be on time.

2147
00:04:02,727 --> 00:04:03,637
Swan?

2148
00:04:03,637 --> 00:04:05,807
I told you in the car, didn't I?

2149
00:04:06,687 --> 00:04:09,147
Am I making a nuisance of myself?

2150
00:04:09,147 --> 00:04:11,857
No, it's just that you weren't wearing your usual lab coat, so...

2151
00:04:11,857 --> 00:04:12,817
Sorry.

2152
00:04:15,107 --> 00:04:19,287
<i>But my will has no effect.</i>

2153
00:04:20,037 --> 00:04:23,497
<i>And I have no influence on Re-l's actions.</i>

2154
00:04:24,077 --> 00:04:27,337
<i>The only one who knows I exist within her...</i>

2155
00:04:27,337 --> 00:04:28,587
<i>is me.</i>

2156
00:04:29,167 --> 00:04:30,457
Good?

2157
00:04:30,917 --> 00:04:31,837
Yeah.

2158
00:04:31,837 --> 00:04:33,467
I see. That's good.

2159
00:04:33,467 --> 00:04:34,677
Indeed.

2160
00:04:34,677 --> 00:04:36,717
The chef here is excellent.

2161
00:04:38,297 --> 00:04:39,717
It's strange...

2162
00:04:40,307 --> 00:04:44,557
Just a short while ago, it was difficult finding enough to eat.

2163
00:04:45,097 --> 00:04:48,977
The outside world and Romdeau are completely different.

2164
00:04:51,227 --> 00:04:54,737
That is why people call Romdeau a cradle.

2165
00:04:55,777 --> 00:05:01,987
And those who would rest within the cradle must be citizens...

2166
00:05:02,497 --> 00:05:04,497
citizens like you and me.

2167
00:05:05,457 --> 00:05:06,997
My grandfather...

2168
00:05:08,377 --> 00:05:12,667
seems to only be happy about what I brought back to Romdeau.

2169
00:05:13,457 --> 00:05:14,797
I understand.

2170
00:05:15,257 --> 00:05:20,217
I understand that what is important to
 Grandfather is finding a way to sustain Romdeau.

2171
00:05:21,967 --> 00:05:27,057
I just happened to act according to his wishes.

2172
00:05:28,227 --> 00:05:29,937
I understand that.

2173
00:05:30,647 --> 00:05:34,527
I know I shouldn't link that thought to what I've lost...

2174
00:05:34,527 --> 00:05:35,527
Re-l...

2175
00:05:35,527 --> 00:05:37,527
I'm just whining, aren't I.

2176
00:05:37,527 --> 00:05:38,277
Sorry.

2177
00:05:45,197 --> 00:05:47,287
<i>Time skipped forward again.</i>

2178
00:05:47,787 --> 00:05:53,457
<i>No, my consciousness was just
 nonexistent during that interval of time.</i>

2179
00:05:54,337 --> 00:05:58,377
<i>This world is very fragmented to me.</i>

2180
00:05:59,587 --> 00:06:02,507
<i>There is something I desperately want to ask Re-l.</i>

2181
00:06:04,097 --> 00:06:07,057
<i>What happened to Pino and me in this city?</i>

2182
00:06:13,187 --> 00:06:16,737
<i>Of course, this question doesn't reach her.</i>

2183
00:06:17,817 --> 00:06:19,277
<i>The next day,</i>

2184
00:06:19,277 --> 00:06:22,117
<i>Re-l started asking to go see the Centzon.</i>

2185
00:06:22,577 --> 00:06:24,537
Talk about thorough preparation.

2186
00:06:24,537 --> 00:06:27,827
I don't want to allow external pathogens to enter Romdeau.

2187
00:06:31,077 --> 00:06:33,337
You're nostalgic, perhaps?

2188
00:06:37,087 --> 00:06:39,177
Do you want to see Vincent Law?

2189
00:06:39,877 --> 00:06:44,137
<i>I heard my name spoken for the first time that day.</i>

2190
00:06:45,387 --> 00:06:48,097
<i>Just as I suspected, I'm somewhere in this city...</i>

2191
00:06:49,557 --> 00:06:50,597
No.

2192
00:06:51,767 --> 00:06:55,567
<i>But for some reason, Re-l refused to see me.</i>

2193
00:06:56,067 --> 00:07:00,107
<i>Unable to exert my will, her world frustrates me.</i>

2194
00:07:00,947 --> 00:07:06,577
<i>Is there any way for me to let her know I'm here?</i>

2195
00:07:07,907 --> 00:07:08,867
What?

2196
00:07:09,157 --> 00:07:13,377
Well, I just felt that you may have changed a bit

2197
00:07:13,747 --> 00:07:15,627
from the way you were before.

2198
00:07:15,627 --> 00:07:16,837
What makes you say that?

2199
00:07:17,587 --> 00:07:22,887
At dinner the other day, you apologized
 three times within a short amount of time.

2200
00:07:23,677 --> 00:07:26,887
The first time was when you couldn't tell who I was.

2201
00:07:26,887 --> 00:07:29,727
The second time was when you talked about the Administrator.

2202
00:07:29,727 --> 00:07:33,397
The third time was when you
 dropped the dessert spoon on the floor.

2203
00:07:35,147 --> 00:07:37,817
It's only natural to apologize when you're at fault, isn't it?

2204
00:07:37,817 --> 00:07:39,187
How awful.

2205
00:07:39,857 --> 00:07:44,157
It seems Daedalus told you
 stories about what a selfish bitch I am.

2206
00:07:44,157 --> 00:07:45,527
See?

2207
00:07:45,527 --> 00:07:49,657
You were like that last night; you're somewhat self-deprecating.

2208
00:07:50,537 --> 00:07:52,417
I didn't hear anything from the Chief.

2209
00:07:52,417 --> 00:07:54,167
I did my own research.

2210
00:07:54,167 --> 00:07:55,627
On me?

2211
00:07:55,627 --> 00:07:56,287
Yes.

2212
00:07:56,997 --> 00:07:59,297
I am your mental health counselor, after all.

2213
00:07:59,297 --> 00:08:00,797
That's news to me!

2214
00:08:00,797 --> 00:08:05,177
I'll take care of you until you can get
 back on your feet as a citizen again.

2215
00:08:05,677 --> 00:08:08,307
You seem worse than an Entourage.

2216
00:08:09,677 --> 00:08:13,017
So, re-indoctrination... to be a model citizen.

2217
00:08:14,517 --> 00:08:18,107
<i>My memory is blank for about a week afterwards.</i>

2218
00:08:19,817 --> 00:08:23,067
<i>I don't know what happened to Re-l during that time.</i>

2219
00:08:23,607 --> 00:08:26,317
I want to show you something, Swan.

2220
00:08:26,317 --> 00:08:27,367
What?

2221
00:08:27,367 --> 00:08:29,327
I haven't even shown it to Daedalus.

2222
00:08:29,657 --> 00:08:31,287
Can you keep a secret?

2223
00:08:41,587 --> 00:08:42,837
An autoreiv...

2224
00:08:44,087 --> 00:08:45,047
Pino!

2225
00:08:45,047 --> 00:08:46,587
Let go! Let go!

2226
00:08:46,587 --> 00:08:47,597
This girl...

2227
00:08:47,597 --> 00:08:50,347
I hate being in the dark! Let me out of here!

2228
00:08:50,347 --> 00:08:51,677
We don't have a choice!

2229
00:08:51,677 --> 00:08:53,427
You're infected!

2230
00:08:53,427 --> 00:08:54,807
I hate you too, Re-l!

2231
00:08:54,807 --> 00:08:56,767
Doing that to Vince!

2232
00:08:57,097 --> 00:08:59,857
I'm gonna get out of here to rescue Vince!

2233
00:08:59,857 --> 00:09:00,897
Don't be ridiculous!

2234
00:09:00,897 --> 00:09:03,067
Do you want to go outside and become scrap metal?

2235
00:09:10,077 --> 00:09:12,617
<i>Pino said she'd rescue me.</i>

2236
00:09:13,157 --> 00:09:16,207
<i>What has actually happened to me?</i>

2237
00:09:17,917 --> 00:09:18,997
Re-l.

2238
00:09:20,087 --> 00:09:22,707
Let's go see Vincent tomorrow.

2239
00:09:23,257 --> 00:09:24,337
It'll be all right.

2240
00:09:24,337 --> 00:09:25,717
I'll be with you.

2241
00:09:31,597 --> 00:09:37,187
It's set so that FP rays will be
 injected into his body at the slightest move.

2242
00:09:38,557 --> 00:09:40,727
This has been explained to him, of course.

2243
00:09:41,187 --> 00:09:46,697
Since you shot an FP bullet in front of
 him before, the warning was effective.

2244
00:09:54,657 --> 00:09:56,037
Vincent...

2245
00:09:57,497 --> 00:10:00,247
Are you sure you can come so close?

2246
00:10:01,287 --> 00:10:04,297
It's been a while, Re-l Mayer.

2247
00:10:04,297 --> 00:10:07,547
It is true that I will die if I make any moves right now.

2248
00:10:07,547 --> 00:10:08,627
However...

2249
00:10:08,627 --> 00:10:11,927
I can at least kill you before I die.

2250
00:10:11,927 --> 00:10:13,557
Then why don't you?

2251
00:10:13,847 --> 00:10:19,057
I just find it wasteful to die for the sake of one traitorous bitch.

2252
00:10:20,307 --> 00:10:23,067
Why... did you betray me?

2253
00:10:23,357 --> 00:10:24,477
Why?

2254
00:10:25,647 --> 00:10:27,567
<i>Re-l betrayed me...</i>

2255
00:10:28,197 --> 00:10:32,067
<i>I never expected to see myself like this through her eyes.</i>

2256
00:10:33,327 --> 00:10:38,077
<i>Are that Vincent Law and this Vincent Law one and the same?</i>

2257
00:10:38,617 --> 00:10:42,587
<i>But he has a will that is distinct from mine...</i>

2258
00:10:43,337 --> 00:10:45,497
<i>So, who am I?</i>

2259
00:10:45,497 --> 00:10:47,627
<i>The "me" within Re-l...</i>

2260
00:10:51,137 --> 00:10:52,717
Was it shocking?

2261
00:10:52,717 --> 00:10:54,097
I'm all right.

2262
00:10:54,597 --> 00:10:59,387
Do you know why I had you see him?

2263
00:10:59,387 --> 00:11:00,347
No.

2264
00:11:00,847 --> 00:11:02,097
Re-l.

2265
00:11:02,097 --> 00:11:05,607
Have you recently felt as though
 you periodically lose track of time?

2266
00:11:05,607 --> 00:11:06,567
No...

2267
00:11:07,027 --> 00:11:08,817
It's just that, in my head...

2268
00:11:09,107 --> 00:11:10,697
In your head?

2269
00:11:11,447 --> 00:11:14,237
It feels as though... someone's talking to me.

2270
00:11:14,237 --> 00:11:16,867
That's Vincent Law.

2271
00:11:18,657 --> 00:11:21,327
Hello, Vincent.

2272
00:11:31,967 --> 00:11:33,797
You can see me?

2273
00:11:35,007 --> 00:11:40,017
I had Re-l see you so that you could see yourself.

2274
00:11:41,597 --> 00:11:44,187
To be sure, Re-l was shocked,

2275
00:11:44,187 --> 00:11:46,477
but compared to the shock you felt...

2276
00:11:47,437 --> 00:11:49,027
So that was why.

2277
00:11:49,027 --> 00:11:50,027
Yes.

2278
00:11:50,777 --> 00:11:53,157
Thanks to the shock of seeing yourself,

2279
00:11:53,607 --> 00:11:56,407
I was able to summon you from within Re-l.

2280
00:11:56,777 --> 00:12:01,617
In order to do so, someone
 needed to acknowledge your existence...

2281
00:12:01,617 --> 00:12:02,997
someone like me.

2282
00:12:02,997 --> 00:12:05,957
Why am I in Miss Re-l?

2283
00:12:05,957 --> 00:12:08,667
Re-l's consciousness is in withdrawal.

2284
00:12:08,667 --> 00:12:10,917
Put more simply, she has multiple personality disorder.

2285
00:12:12,467 --> 00:12:16,927
Her guilt, the fact that she betrayed Vincent Law,

2286
00:12:17,257 --> 00:12:22,017
has created you as a separate personality.

2287
00:12:22,557 --> 00:12:23,887
Wait a minute.

2288
00:12:23,887 --> 00:12:24,937
Then I'm...

2289
00:12:25,307 --> 00:12:26,647
I'm...

2290
00:12:26,647 --> 00:12:28,977
not Vincent Law?

2291
00:12:28,977 --> 00:12:30,687
Not in a real sense, no.

2292
00:12:30,687 --> 00:12:31,857
But that's...

2293
00:12:31,857 --> 00:12:34,447
Have you felt as though you've lost track of time?

2294
00:12:35,527 --> 00:12:37,197
Y-Yes.

2295
00:12:37,567 --> 00:12:41,947
That's incontrovertible proof that you're not Vincent Law himself.

2296
00:12:42,327 --> 00:12:45,787
If your will existed as an independent entity,

2297
00:12:46,247 --> 00:12:50,667
you wouldn't let the will of another
 person such as Re-l infringe on yours.

2298
00:12:51,257 --> 00:12:54,927
Just like she subconsciously created you,

2299
00:12:54,927 --> 00:12:57,757
she is subconsciously making your consciousness "skip".

2300
00:12:57,757 --> 00:12:59,597
What should I do?

2301
00:12:59,597 --> 00:13:04,477
Removing you by force would only destabilize Re-l.

2302
00:13:05,477 --> 00:13:07,767
This session ends here.

2303
00:13:07,767 --> 00:13:09,977
Let's meet again, Vincent.

2304
00:13:10,437 --> 00:13:13,277
Go back to Re-l after I count from ten.

2305
00:13:13,277 --> 00:13:14,487
Ten...

2306
00:13:14,487 --> 00:13:15,567
Nine...

2307
00:13:15,567 --> 00:13:16,567
Eight...

2308
00:13:16,567 --> 00:13:17,567
Seven...

2309
00:13:16,777 --> 00:13:17,987
Wait.

2310
00:13:17,567 --> 00:13:18,567
Six...

2311
00:13:17,987 --> 00:13:20,157
I still want to talk to you.

2312
00:13:18,567 --> 00:13:19,527
Five...

2313
00:13:19,527 --> 00:13:20,487
Four...

2314
00:13:20,487 --> 00:13:21,487
Three...

2315
00:13:21,487 --> 00:13:22,747
Two...

2316
00:13:22,747 --> 00:13:23,697
One.

2317
00:13:26,167 --> 00:13:29,167
Vincent's inside me?

2318
00:13:29,167 --> 00:13:30,747
That idea is in poor taste.

2319
00:13:38,887 --> 00:13:40,967
<i>Miss Re-l! Don't touch it!</i>

2320
00:13:53,647 --> 00:13:55,317
Hello, Vincent.

2321
00:13:55,317 --> 00:13:56,697
It's been a week.

2322
00:13:59,447 --> 00:14:02,197
I thought Re-l wouldn't come here anymore.

2323
00:14:02,197 --> 00:14:03,037
What?

2324
00:14:03,327 --> 00:14:06,247
Do you know Re-l called me?

2325
00:14:07,827 --> 00:14:09,077
No...

2326
00:14:09,377 --> 00:14:11,087
I recorded the call.

2327
00:14:12,247 --> 00:14:15,457
Swan, I'm not coming back to the clinic anymore.

2328
00:14:15,457 --> 00:14:18,717
It's true that the matter concerning Vincent is bothering me,

2329
00:14:18,717 --> 00:14:21,597
but it's also unpleasant to have such things said to me.

2330
00:14:22,177 --> 00:14:25,097
I'd thought we could have an easygoing relationship, but...

2331
00:14:25,427 --> 00:14:26,727
It's unfortunate.

2332
00:14:28,937 --> 00:14:30,847
But Re-l came.

2333
00:14:34,147 --> 00:14:39,277
If Re-l's consciousness is skipping just like yours does...

2334
00:14:39,277 --> 00:14:45,407
No, that she came here means that
 your will subconsciously asserted itself.

2335
00:14:45,407 --> 00:14:46,617
My will did...?

2336
00:14:46,617 --> 00:14:47,867
Come out, Re-l.

2337
00:14:51,827 --> 00:14:53,417
Why am I here?

2338
00:14:53,417 --> 00:14:55,377
Last I remember, I was in my room and...

2339
00:14:58,127 --> 00:14:58,757
Swan!

2340
00:14:59,677 --> 00:15:00,797
Swan?

2341
00:15:01,507 --> 00:15:02,587
Where am I?

2342
00:15:03,047 --> 00:15:03,757
Vincent.

2343
00:15:05,557 --> 00:15:07,927
It's your doing, isn't it, Vincent.

2344
00:15:07,927 --> 00:15:09,097
Mine...?

2345
00:15:09,387 --> 00:15:12,977
You're subconsciously trying to take over Re-l.

2346
00:15:13,307 --> 00:15:14,267
"Take over"?!

2347
00:15:14,607 --> 00:15:17,147
All this time, you've been waiting for a chance, haven't you?

2348
00:15:17,147 --> 00:15:18,527
While studying her...

2349
00:15:18,527 --> 00:15:19,607
Stop!

2350
00:15:21,237 --> 00:15:23,447
Swan, I...

2351
00:15:23,987 --> 00:15:26,287
What should I do?

2352
00:15:26,287 --> 00:15:29,497
What can I do to disappear from inside Re-l?

2353
00:15:29,497 --> 00:15:30,617
You don't mind disappearing?

2354
00:15:31,117 --> 00:15:33,627
If it's to save Re-l...

2355
00:15:34,127 --> 00:15:37,457
You know how, don't you, Swan?

2356
00:15:37,457 --> 00:15:39,127
There is a way.

2357
00:15:40,587 --> 00:15:42,377
Show her your past.

2358
00:15:42,677 --> 00:15:43,717
My past...

2359
00:15:44,177 --> 00:15:46,217
That'd be difficult.

2360
00:15:46,217 --> 00:15:48,767
I don't have memories of my past.

2361
00:15:48,767 --> 00:15:50,097
That's all right.

2362
00:15:51,597 --> 00:15:54,397
You're not Vincent anyway.

2363
00:15:54,767 --> 00:15:56,817
It can be a past of your choosing.

2364
00:15:56,817 --> 00:15:58,647
A past of my choosing...

2365
00:15:59,147 --> 00:16:01,527
Put another way, your desires...

2366
00:16:02,357 --> 00:16:03,907
Relax.

2367
00:16:04,817 --> 00:16:07,527
You will travel to a world of your desires...

2368
00:16:08,697 --> 00:16:10,947
to a world <i>you</i> desire.

2369
00:16:22,667 --> 00:16:24,047
And what about that?

2370
00:16:24,047 --> 00:16:26,797
Yes, sir. It's all going smoothly.

2371
00:16:26,797 --> 00:16:30,307
Having talented subordinates like you makes my job easier.

2372
00:16:30,307 --> 00:16:31,477
Thank you, sir.

2373
00:16:31,477 --> 00:16:32,767
By the way,

2374
00:16:33,437 --> 00:16:35,397
I hear you're quite the loving husband.

2375
00:16:35,397 --> 00:16:36,557
Who said that?

2376
00:16:36,937 --> 00:16:39,357
It's nothing to be embarrassed about, is it?

2377
00:16:39,357 --> 00:16:42,067
As someone who'll soon have a family,

2378
00:16:42,357 --> 00:16:45,277
I'd like to ask you what the secret to a happy marriage is.

2379
00:16:57,077 --> 00:16:58,707
Are you not enjoying yourself?

2380
00:16:59,287 --> 00:17:01,507
We're both so busy.

2381
00:17:01,507 --> 00:17:03,717
Oh, is that why you're sulking?

2382
00:17:03,717 --> 00:17:07,717
With me as the Security Bureau Chief and
 you as an Information Bureau career woman,

2383
00:17:07,717 --> 00:17:10,847
it's inevitable that finding time to see each other is difficult.

2384
00:17:10,847 --> 00:17:15,137
Besides, once you two get married, you'll be
 seeing more of each other than you'd like every day.

2385
00:17:15,137 --> 00:17:16,267
Daedalus.

2386
00:17:16,267 --> 00:17:18,437
I'm sorry that my sister's so selfish.

2387
00:17:18,437 --> 00:17:19,687
You're late.

2388
00:17:19,687 --> 00:17:22,607
Sorry, sorry. My classes ran late.

2389
00:17:22,607 --> 00:17:23,987
I wonder.

2390
00:17:23,987 --> 00:17:26,407
I heard that you don't actually go to school much.

2391
00:17:26,407 --> 00:17:28,067
It's boring.

2392
00:17:28,567 --> 00:17:33,037
Don't worry though. I'll make sure I attend enough to pass.

2393
00:17:33,037 --> 00:17:36,287
I've heard that you're an excellent student, Daedalus.

2394
00:17:36,287 --> 00:17:38,497
Only when it comes to test scores.

2395
00:17:38,787 --> 00:17:42,627
I've heard a lot about you as well, Chief Vincent.

2396
00:17:43,127 --> 00:17:49,257
Do you feel comfortable with the fact that a model
 citizen like yourself is marrying my tomboy of a sister-

2397
00:17:48,587 --> 00:17:49,797
Daedalus.

2398
00:17:49,797 --> 00:17:55,477
Well, I'm only too happy to welcome you as my brother.

2399
00:17:55,477 --> 00:17:58,017
I'm happy you'll be my brother as well.

2400
00:17:59,607 --> 00:18:01,817
Honestly, he's so cheeky.

2401
00:18:01,817 --> 00:18:04,027
But I'm glad he likes me.

2402
00:18:04,027 --> 00:18:06,817
I've never come across anyone who doesn't.

2403
00:18:06,817 --> 00:18:09,567
Everyone likes you - it's almost annoying.

2404
00:18:09,867 --> 00:18:11,197
Jealous?

2405
00:18:12,157 --> 00:18:13,827
I never said that.

2406
00:18:16,707 --> 00:18:17,997
Oops.

2407
00:18:19,207 --> 00:18:21,077
Miss Re-l, don't touch it!

2408
00:18:27,627 --> 00:18:29,087
It's been a week,

2409
00:18:30,087 --> 00:18:31,087
Re-l.

2410
00:18:33,467 --> 00:18:36,097
Why am I... here again?

2411
00:18:36,097 --> 00:18:37,387
It's all right, Re-l.

2412
00:18:37,387 --> 00:18:38,937
I'm so glad, Re-l!

2413
00:18:39,227 --> 00:18:41,807
I was worried because you weren't home.

2414
00:18:41,807 --> 00:18:44,317
Did you play hooky from school again, Daedalus?

2415
00:18:44,317 --> 00:18:45,937
What are you talking about, Re-l?

2416
00:18:45,937 --> 00:18:47,237
Get a hold of yourself.

2417
00:18:47,607 --> 00:18:49,357
Vincent Law has escaped!

2418
00:18:50,777 --> 00:18:54,867
A cogito-infected companion-type autoreiv broke in and...

2419
00:18:55,447 --> 00:18:57,537
He'll probably find you and attack you.

2420
00:18:58,707 --> 00:19:00,957
If it comes to that, use this.

2421
00:19:05,707 --> 00:19:07,877
Swan, please look after Re-l.

2422
00:19:09,837 --> 00:19:11,797
You let him escape, didn't you.

2423
00:19:12,427 --> 00:19:13,887
I... don't know.

2424
00:19:13,887 --> 00:19:15,177
I... don't know.

2425
00:19:15,467 --> 00:19:16,927
I told you.

2426
00:19:16,927 --> 00:19:18,177
It's subconscious.

2427
00:19:21,057 --> 00:19:24,187
Re-l, you loved Vincent.

2428
00:19:24,187 --> 00:19:25,517
Of course.

2429
00:19:25,517 --> 00:19:27,687
Vincent is my fiancÃ©.

2430
00:19:28,027 --> 00:19:29,237
See?

2431
00:19:29,817 --> 00:19:30,697
Vincent,

2432
00:19:31,527 --> 00:19:36,117
you haphazardly mixed actual memories with your desires.

2433
00:19:36,117 --> 00:19:37,947
So Re-l is confused.

2434
00:19:38,407 --> 00:19:42,537
She has lost sight of the distinction
 between her real past and your desires.

2435
00:19:43,037 --> 00:19:44,627
Isn't that right, Re-l?

2436
00:19:45,417 --> 00:19:47,587
Vincent's coming to see me!

2437
00:19:47,957 --> 00:19:49,507
Wait, Vincent!

2438
00:19:51,797 --> 00:19:53,427
What should I do?

2439
00:19:54,587 --> 00:19:55,717
Kill Re-l.

2440
00:19:57,257 --> 00:20:00,677
You only exist in Re-l's imagination

2441
00:20:00,677 --> 00:20:04,477
so that she can escape from the
 fact that she betrayed Vincent Law.

2442
00:20:04,767 --> 00:20:08,977
So if you kill Re-l in her imagination,

2443
00:20:08,977 --> 00:20:11,857
her split identity will become one.

2444
00:20:12,487 --> 00:20:14,867
Let us visit the past you desired again...

2445
00:20:31,797 --> 00:20:33,547
Vince!

2446
00:20:33,547 --> 00:20:35,257
I missed you!

2447
00:20:35,257 --> 00:20:36,257
Pino...

2448
00:20:38,307 --> 00:20:40,427
Why do you have something like that?

2449
00:20:40,427 --> 00:20:41,807
I have to...

2450
00:20:41,807 --> 00:20:43,847
kill Re-l.

2451
00:20:43,847 --> 00:20:44,637
What?

2452
00:20:45,147 --> 00:20:46,977
To save her.

2453
00:20:46,977 --> 00:20:49,017
To save Re-l-Re-l?

2454
00:20:49,687 --> 00:20:50,527
Yeah...

2455
00:20:50,817 --> 00:20:54,987
It's okay to kill Re-l-Re-l, even though we're trying to save her?

2456
00:20:54,987 --> 00:20:56,157
Yeah...

2457
00:20:56,157 --> 00:20:58,947
This world isn't real, so...

2458
00:21:00,157 --> 00:21:03,287
Well, not that you'd know what I'm talking about, but...

2459
00:21:04,497 --> 00:21:06,787
Then let's kill Re-l-Re-l.

2460
00:21:11,087 --> 00:21:12,167
Hey, Pino...

2461
00:21:12,507 --> 00:21:13,587
What are you...

2462
00:21:14,467 --> 00:21:17,927
There's no need to ask; I'll kill her.

2463
00:21:17,927 --> 00:21:18,427
See?

2464
00:21:19,717 --> 00:21:21,467
This isn't real.

2465
00:21:21,467 --> 00:21:22,177
Swan.

2466
00:21:23,057 --> 00:21:24,937
This is Re-l's imaginary world.

2467
00:21:25,477 --> 00:21:26,387
So...

2468
00:21:26,387 --> 00:21:29,437
The other you must kill her.

2469
00:21:30,727 --> 00:21:31,437
Kill her...

2470
00:21:32,357 --> 00:21:32,937
Kill her!

2471
00:21:33,317 --> 00:21:33,857
Kill her!!!

2472
00:21:36,607 --> 00:21:37,607
You're wrong.

2473
00:21:38,947 --> 00:21:41,487
I should've noticed from the start.

2474
00:21:41,487 --> 00:21:45,747
I would never let this go, even for Miss Re-l.

2475
00:21:46,407 --> 00:21:49,247
The point at which Miss Re-l had the necklace,

2476
00:21:49,247 --> 00:21:52,667
made a world like this plainly impossible.

2477
00:21:53,627 --> 00:21:56,507
Then... who are you here?

2478
00:21:58,127 --> 00:22:01,257
If this world isn't real, who are you?

2479
00:22:01,637 --> 00:22:03,387
You're here.

2480
00:22:03,387 --> 00:22:05,677
Are you going to reject that existence?

2481
00:22:06,227 --> 00:22:09,097
You've lost sense of who you are,

2482
00:22:09,097 --> 00:22:11,937
so you'll never find anywhere to belong,

2483
00:22:12,727 --> 00:22:14,187
Vincent...

2484
00:22:14,187 --> 00:22:17,447
But... it's not here.

2485
00:22:17,447 --> 00:22:18,777
I'm not <i>here</i>.

2486
00:22:18,777 --> 00:22:20,067
I don't like it.

2487
00:22:20,367 --> 00:22:23,117
I can't take this off, no matter what...

2488
00:22:23,697 --> 00:22:26,407
Your... necklace.

2489
00:22:27,077 --> 00:22:28,617
You're also a PROXY.

2490
00:22:28,957 --> 00:22:32,287
I don't like men who smell of other women.

2491
00:22:32,997 --> 00:22:35,257
The necklace feels the same way too, I'm sure.

2492
00:22:36,297 --> 00:22:39,127
Even so, I want to protect Re-l.

2493
00:22:39,837 --> 00:22:40,637
I see.

2494
00:22:45,717 --> 00:22:47,387
No, Re-l-Re-l!

2495
00:22:47,727 --> 00:22:48,887
Goodbye.

2496
00:23:09,157 --> 00:23:10,537
Vincent,

2497
00:23:10,867 --> 00:23:12,247
it's my turn.

2498
00:23:13,877 --> 00:23:15,047
What's the matter?

2499
00:23:15,047 --> 00:23:17,837
Where... are we?

2500
00:23:17,837 --> 00:23:18,877
What are you talking about?

2501
00:23:20,967 --> 00:23:21,887
It's nothing.

2502
00:23:22,177 --> 00:23:23,387
Get a grip.

2503
00:23:23,387 --> 00:23:24,967
Romdeau's near.

2504
00:23:24,967 --> 00:23:26,177
Romdeau...

2505
00:23:26,677 --> 00:23:28,517
You're not the only one who's anxious.

2506
00:23:29,517 --> 00:23:31,687
I wonder what's going to happen...

2507
00:23:32,397 --> 00:23:34,187
to you and me.

2508
00:23:39,107 --> 00:23:41,527
"I think, therefore you are", huh.

2509
00:23:43,367 --> 00:23:47,287
Will you give me that necklace before we reach Romdeau?

2510
00:23:47,287 --> 00:23:48,197
What?

2511
00:23:49,497 --> 00:23:50,787
I just felt like asking.

2512
00:23:51,667 --> 00:23:53,917
Get some rest, Vincent.

2513
00:23:54,747 --> 00:23:56,707
Good night, Miss Re-l.

2514
00:23:57,047 --> 00:23:59,457
Good night, Vincent.

